      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm looking into some issues with a recent asphalt paving project here in Phoenix. We're seeing some premature longitudinal cracking on a section that was laid only a few months ago. Can you give me a technical summary of the most common causes for this type of pavement failure, specifically looking at the relationship between thermal expansion, bitumen viscosity, and subgrade compaction?",
